# Deploy without asking

When website work is done (layout, copy, or feature changes that should go live):

1. Commit the relevant files on `main`.
2. Push to `origin` (`git push origin HEAD`). Vercel auto-deploys production at www.sonali.events.
3. Do not wait for a second “go live” confirmation.

Do not invent social proof, testimonials, degrees, or Instagram. Do not lead public pages with the proprietor’s full name — the house and teams come first; founder belongs on About as a fact.
